# The list with art on a card that still holds a placeholder v0.4's first
# builds made (/torii/art/box-gba.bin; a test picture stands in for it):
# the kernel ignores it (it lists no art), so a game without art keeps the
# drawn GBA box once the cursor has rested.
#! settings 31=1
#! sd-file /torii/art/box-gba.bin 0 tests/shots/data/art-night.bin
-w "nav: home ready"
-k @8:RIGHT -k @12:-
-k @20:A -k @24:-
-w "nav: page gba ready"
-w "box art: 0 files listed"
-s @40:gba.png
